<title>SPAIN: Cofir 1.46 mln share cancellation approved.</title>
<headline>Cofir 1.46 mln share cancellation approved.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's National Stock Market Commission said on Friday investment firm Corporacion Financiera Reunida (Cofir) approved a 582.4 million peseta capital reduction via the cancellation of 1.46 million shares from its treasury stock.</p>
<p>The move was backed by shareholders, who also gave the go-ahead for the firm to continue to buy back its own shares, CNMV said.</p>
<p>At 0930 GMT shares in Cofir were up 8 pesetas to 636.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
